      "@type": "Scene",
      "instance_name": "hands_up_scene",
      "label": "people raising hands in a group setting",
      "description": "A diverse group of people are seated in a row, all raising their hands in what appears to be a classroom or meeting setting. The visual composition suggests a collective action or response, with individuals positioned in a linear arrangement from foreground to background. The scene is overlaid with text that reads 'hands up all racists who support white genocide,' which creates a jarring contrast between the passive, cooperative gesture of raising hands and the hateful, racially charged message. The participants are visually connected through their shared action and spatial alignment.",
