      "label": "Racist Stereotype",
      "description": "A generalized and often derogatory belief or assumption about a racial or ethnic group, used to justify discrimination, prejudice, or violence. In this meme, the term 'racist' is used as a label to target individuals based on their race, which is a form of racial stereotyping and scapegoating.",
