      "description": "A meme designed to spread hatred, incite violence, or promote discriminatory ideologies. This meme uses the visual of people raising hands (typically associated with cooperation or compliance) to juxtapose with a hateful message that targets individuals based on race and promotes a false and dangerous conspiracy theory. The intent is to provoke outrage and reinforce extremist narratives.",
