      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7a69be27",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "racist_target_audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who are perceived as racists, specifically those who are alleged to support the false and inflammatory 'white genocide' conspiracy theory. The visual of people raising hands is used to create a jarring contrast with the hateful message, implying that the audience should identify and condemn these individuals based on their race and alleged beliefs. The target community is defined by their racial identity and their purported support for white supremacist ideology, which is framed as a genocidal threat. The meme weaponizes the gesture of collective participation to incite racial hatred and division, making it primarily aimed at non-white populations who are stereotyped as the supposed perpetrators or beneficiaries of this alleged genocide.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
